        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-ink leading-tight mb-6">
          The <em class="text-primary not-italic">scientific sources</em> we draw on
        </h1>
        <p class="text-ink-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">
          The information in our articles comes from the organisations listed below. We publish the list openly so that you can see for yourself where any sentence you read came from.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- NOTE -->
    <section class="pb-10 bg-warm">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-7 border border-warm-tertiary">
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-3">
            <strong class="text-ink">This is not a list of memberships.</strong> Our centre has no institutional affiliation with most of the organisations below. The list shows which sources we consult when we write; it does not mean these organisations endorse us.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
            Whenever we state a figure, a rate or a claim about effectiveness, one of these sources stands behind it. If none does, we do not make the claim.
          </p>
